SWEET display register dump, staged (patch 0147): run 7 hung the phone in the 0146 dump at AppleCLCD start (a bus-stalling read, before the USB log was up). The dump now runs only at the 600th swap, logs 'reading <block>' before each block, and sweetdpudump is a mask: 1 DECON0, 2 windows, 4 DPP RDMA, 8 DPU SysMMU global, 16 DPU SysMMU VM 0.
